<title>USA: U.S. Defense Stockpile awards tin under tender.</title>
<headline>U.S. Defense Stockpile awards tin under tender.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The U.S. Defense Stockpile said it has awarded 60 tonnes of tin valued at $351,726.30 under its monthly tender programme.</p>
<p>Buyers were Ney Smelting of Brooklyn, New York for 20 tonnes worth $117,465.50 and Allied Deals, of New York, for 40 tonnes worth $234,260.80.</p>
<p>The next tender will be on May 7, 1997.</p>
<p>-New York Commodities Desk, +1-212-859-1640.</p>
